  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large skillet, heat the olive oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Add the Jamon Iberico and cook for 2 minutes until lightly browned.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together the anko red bean paste and render fat.",
    "Spread the red bean paste mixture over the Jamon Iberico.",
    "Sprinkle the manchego cheese over the top.",
    "Transfer the skillet to the preheated oven and bake for 10 minutes until the cheese is melted and bubbly.",
    "Remove from the oven and sprinkle with smoked paprika, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
